<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>行人意图预测 on 孙博士的教程博客</title><link>https://skysunsun.github.io/The-way-back/tags/%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B/</link><description>Recent content in 行人意图预测 on 孙博士的教程博客</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://skysunsun.github.io/The-way-back/tags/%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%BA%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>AsymFreq-PIP：用频率域特征做行人过街意图预测</title><link>https://skysunsun.github.io/The-way-back/research/asymfreq-pip/</link><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://skysunsun.github.io/The-way-back/research/asymfreq-pip/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;行人过街意图预测（Pedestrian Intent Prediction, PIP）的目标是在行人真正&#10;横穿马路之前，尽早给出「过街 / 不过街」的判断。本文介绍我们提出的&#10;&lt;strong&gt;AsymFreq-PIP&lt;/strong&gt; 模型核心思路：用 &lt;strong&gt;DCT 低频 + Haar 小波 + 非对称池化&lt;/strong&gt;&#10;提取时序特征，并以幂均值集成（power-mean ensemble）进一步提升精度。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>